    "%@ at %@" : {
      "comment" : "A moment on another day. The first %@ is the date, such as \"October 1\" or \"October 1, 2025\"; the second is the time of day, such as 3:05 PM.\nAn amount of time followed by the speed it counts at. %1$@ is the amount with its words, such as \"3:44:01 left\" or \"Total time: 4 hours\"; %2$@ is the speed, such as \"2.0x\", \"2.0 times speed\" or \"500 words a minute\".",
      "localizations" : {
