    "%@ by %@" : {
      "comment" : "A book named in a row of Compare Libraries. %1$@ is its title and %2$@ its author.\nThe shared title and author of a group of duplicate books that match by both, in the group's heading. %1$@ is the title and %2$@ is the author.",
