          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Аудиокнига «%@» сейчас расшифровывается. Исправьте расшифровку после её завершения."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is filed %@ in %@ and %@ in %@." : {
      "comment" : "A difference found by Compare Libraries. %1$@ is a book's title, %2$@ says where this copy files it (at the top of the library, or in a folder), %3$@ is this copy, %4$@ says where the other copy files it, %5$@ is the other copy.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ ist abgelegt: %3$@ %2$@, %5$@ %4$@."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ is filed %2$@ in %3$@ and %4$@ in %5$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "En %3$@, %1$@ está %2$@; en %5$@, está %4$@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%@ est classé %@ dans %@ et %@ dans %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%@ si trova %@ in %@ e %@ in %@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Em %3$@, %1$@ está %2$@; em %5$@, está %4$@."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@: %3$@ — %2$@; %5$@ — %4$@."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@: у %3$@ — %2$@, у %5$@ — %4$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ 在 %3$@ 中归档于%2$@，在 %5$@ 中归档于%4$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is in %@, which TextMouth on iPhone can't play yet." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the refusal of an audio file the iPhone can't convert. %1$@ is the file's quoted name, or \"This file\". %2$@ is the audio format's name, as in \"Ogg\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ liegt als %2$@ vor, was TextMouth auf dem iPhone noch nicht wiedergeben kann."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ is in %2$@, which TextMouth on iPhone can't play yet."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ está en %2$@, que TextMouth en el iPhone aún no puede reproducir."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ est au format %2$@, que TextMouth sur iPhone ne peut pas encore lire."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ è in %2$@, che TextMouth su iPhone non può ancora riprodurre."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ está em %2$@, que o TextMouth no iPhone ainda não consegue reproduzir."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ в формате %2$@, который TextMouth на iPhone пока не может воспроизвести."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is in a skipped section, so the cursor is %@." : {
      "comment" : "Announcement after Go to Page when every word of the page typed is in a skipped section. %1$@ names the page, such as \"Page 40\" or \"The first page labelled 3\"; %2$@ says where the cursor is, such as \"on page 52\" or \"before page 1\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ liegt in einem übersprungenen Abschnitt, daher steht der Cursor %2$@."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ is in a skipped section, so the cursor is %2$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ está en una sección omitida, así que el cursor está %2$@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%@ se trouve dans une section ignorée, le curseur est donc %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%@ si trova in una sezione saltata, quindi il cursore è %@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ está em uma seção ignorada, então o cursor está %2$@."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ в пропущенном разделе, курсор %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ 位于已跳过的部分，因此光标%2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is in your library, unsubscribed. Choose %@ on its row, or in its %@, to check it again." : {
      "comment" : "Why Subscribe refused: the feed is in the library but unsubscribed. The first %@ is the feed's title; the second is the name of the Resubscribe command; the third is the name of the Feed Info sheet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ ist in deiner Bibliothek, aber abbestellt. Wähle %2$@ in der Zeile oder unter %3$@, um den Feed erneut zu prüfen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ is in your library, unsubscribed. Choose %2$@ on its row, or in its %3$@, to check it again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ está en tu biblioteca, sin suscripción. Elige %2$@ en su fila, o en su %3$@, para volver a revisarlo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ figure dans votre bibliothèque, mais sans abonnement. Choisissez %2$@ sur sa ligne, ou dans %3$@, pour le vérifier de nouveau."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ è nella tua libreria, ma l’iscrizione è annullata. Scegli %2$@ nella sua riga, o nel foglio %3$@, per controllarlo di nuovo."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ está na sua biblioteca, sem assinatura. Escolha %2$@ na linha dele, ou em %3$@, para verificá-lo novamente."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ уже в вашей библиотеке, но вы от неё отписались. Выберите %2$@ в строке ленты или в листе %3$@, чтобы снова проверять её."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ є в бібліотеці без підписки. Виберіть %2$@ у рядку стрічки або в аркуші «%3$@», щоб перевірити знову."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is kept on this Mac for the reading list." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why Stop Keeping on This Mac changed nothing for one book: the reading list keeps it. %@ is the book's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%@ wird für die Leseliste auf diesem Mac behalten."
