          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Пресет «%1$@» перемещён на позицию %2$lld из %3$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ moves an episode or article downloaded in its feed. Select one in its feed's folder." : {
      "comment" : "What VoiceOver says when Move to Library is chosen and no selected book is a feed's download. %@ is the name of the Move to Library command, with its ellipsis.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%@ verschiebt Heruntergeladenes aus einem Feed, etwa eine Folge oder einen Artikel. Wähle dazu im Ordner des Feeds einen Eintrag aus."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%@ mueve un episodio o artículo descargado en su canal. Selecciona uno en la carpeta de su canal."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%@ déplace un épisode ou un article téléchargé dans son flux. Sélectionnez-en un dans le dossier de son flux."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%@ sposta un episodio o un articolo scaricato dal suo feed. Selezionane uno nella cartella del feed."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%@ move um episódio ou artigo baixado de um feed. Selecione um na pasta do feed."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%@ перемещает выпуск или статью, загруженные из ленты. Выберите выпуск или статью в папке ленты."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%@ переміщує епізод або статтю, завантажені зі стрічки. Виберіть такий елемент у папці його стрічки."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ needs “%@”, one of a Mac's own braille tables, which TextMouth on iPhone doesn't have." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the refusal of a braille book that needs a braille table only a Mac has. %1$@ is the file's quoted name, or \"This file\". %2$@ is the table's file name, as in \"fr-bfu-g2.ctb\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ benötigt „%2$@“, eine der eigenen Brailletabellen eines Mac, die TextMouth auf dem iPhone nicht hat."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ needs “%2$@”, one of a Mac's own braille tables, which TextMouth on iPhone doesn't have."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ necesita «%2$@», una de las tablas de braille propias de una Mac, que TextMouth en el iPhone no tiene."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ nécessite « %2$@ », l’une des tables braille propres à un Mac, que TextMouth sur iPhone n’a pas."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ richiede “%2$@”, una delle tabelle braille di un Mac, che TextMouth su iPhone non ha."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ precisa de “%2$@”, uma das tabelas braille do próprio Mac, que o TextMouth no iPhone não tem."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ требует таблицу «%2$@», одну из собственных таблиц Брайля на Mac, которой нет в TextMouth на iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ nests too deeply" : {
      "comment" : "The title of the alert an export shows when a chapter nests quotes, lists, or emphasis too deeply. %@ names what nests, such as \"Chapter 2 of Deep Notes\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%@ ist zu tief verschachtelt"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Anidado demasiado profundo: %@"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%@ est imbriqué trop profondément"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "%@ è annidato troppo in profondità"
          }
