    },
    "Apply" : {
      "comment" : "Button of the Clean Up Transcript sheet that makes the corrections in the transcript.\nButton of the audio editor's Apply Filter sheet that applies the filter.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Anwenden"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Aplicar"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Appliquer"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Applica"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Aplicar"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Применить"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply Filter" : {
      "comment" : "Name of an edit, as the Undo and Redo menu items say it after \"Undo\" or \"Redo\"; also the title of the audio editor's filter sheet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Filter anwenden"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Aplicar filtro"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Appliquer le filtre"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Applica filtro"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Aplicar filtro"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Применить фильтр"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply Filter lists these in this order. Each is a chain of filters in ffmpeg's syntax, such as highpass=f=80,volume=3dB. TextMouth runs its own filters, plus every ffmpeg filter when ffmpeg is installed and turned on above." : {
      "comment" : "Explains the filter presets sheet. Apply Filter is the audio editor's command. \"highpass=f=80,volume=3dB\" is filter syntax and stays as it is. ffmpeg is the name of a program. \"turned on above\" refers to the Use ffmpeg for filters switch in Storage settings.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "„Filter anwenden“ listet diese in dieser Reihenfolge auf. Jede ist eine Filterkette in der Syntax von ffmpeg, etwa highpass=f=80,volume=3dB. TextMouth führt seine eigenen Filter aus, dazu jeden ffmpeg-Filter, wenn ffmpeg installiert und oben aktiviert ist."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Aplicar filtro muestra estos en este orden. Cada uno es una cadena de filtros con la sintaxis de ffmpeg, como highpass=f=80,volume=3dB. TextMouth ejecuta sus propios filtros, y también todos los de ffmpeg cuando ffmpeg está instalado y activado arriba."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Appliquer le filtre les propose dans cet ordre. Chacun est une chaîne de filtres en syntaxe ffmpeg, par exemple highpass=f=80,volume=3dB. TextMouth exécute ses propres filtres, ainsi que tous les filtres ffmpeg lorsque ffmpeg est installé et activé ci-dessus."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Applica filtro li elenca in quest’ordine. Ognuno è una catena di filtri nella sintassi di ffmpeg, come highpass=f=80,volume=3dB. TextMouth esegue i propri filtri, più tutti i filtri di ffmpeg quando ffmpeg è installato e attivato qui sopra."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Aplicar filtro lista estas predefinições nesta ordem. Cada uma é uma cadeia de filtros na sintaxe do ffmpeg, como highpass=f=80,volume=3dB. O TextMouth executa os próprios filtros, além de todos os filtros do ffmpeg quando ele está instalado e ativado acima."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "В списке «Применить фильтр» они идут в этом порядке. Каждый пресет — цепочка фильтров в синтаксисе ffmpeg, например highpass=f=80,volume=3dB. TextMouth выполняет собственные фильтры и все фильтры ffmpeg, если ffmpeg установлен и включён выше."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply Filter plays a preview first, and applies when you choose Apply again." : {
      "comment" : "Hint of the Preview filters before applying switch in Storage settings. Apply Filter and Apply are the audio editor's command and button.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "„Filter anwenden“ gibt zuerst eine Vorschau wieder und wendet den Filter an, wenn du erneut „Anwenden“ wählst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Aplicar filtro reproduce primero una vista previa y aplica el filtro cuando eliges Aplicar de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Appliquer le filtre lit d’abord un aperçu, puis applique le filtre quand vous choisissez Appliquer à nouveau."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Applica filtro riproduce prima un’anteprima e applica il filtro quando scegli di nuovo Applica."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Aplicar filtro reproduz uma prévia primeiro e aplica quando você escolhe Aplicar de novo."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Команда «Применить фильтр» сначала воспроизводит предварительный фрагмент, а применяет фильтр, когда вы снова выбираете «Применить»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
