    "If %@ arrives from %@ later, %@ may keep two copies of it." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of the question asked before opening the library without its index file. %1$@ is the index file's name, which stays as written; %2$@ and %3$@ are the cloud service's name, or \"the cloud\" when it is unknown.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Wenn %1$@ später von %2$@ eintrifft, behält %3$@ möglicherweise zwei Kopien davon."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "If %1$@ arrives from %2$@ later, %3$@ may keep two copies of it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Si %1$@ llega más tarde desde %2$@, puede que %3$@ conserve dos copias."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Si %1$@ arrive plus tard depuis %2$@, %3$@ peut en conserver deux copies."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se %@ arriva più tardi tramite %@, %@ potrebbe conservarne due copie."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se %1$@ chegar de %2$@ mais tarde, %3$@ poderá manter duas cópias dele."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Если %1$@ позже поступит через %2$@, %3$@ может сохранить две копии."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Якщо %1$@ пізніше надійде (джерело: %2$@), %3$@ може зберегти дві його копії."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "如果稍后 %1$@ 从 %2$@ 传来，%3$@ 可能会保留它的两个副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it is gone, choose %@." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of why the library can't open, pointing to the button that opens it anyway. %@ is that button's name, without its ellipsis. \"It\" is the missing file.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Wenn sie fehlt, wähle %@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Si ya no está, elige %@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "S’il a disparu, choisissez %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se non c’è più, scegli %@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se ele sumiu, escolha %@."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Если его нет, выберите «%@»."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Якщо його немає, виберіть «%@»."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "如果它已不存在，请选择 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the file arrives from %@ later, it names the same library." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of the question asked before restoring the library's identity file. %@ is the cloud service's name, or \"the cloud\" when it is unknown.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Wenn die Datei später von %@ eintrifft, benennt sie dieselbe Bibliothek."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Si el archivo llega más tarde desde %@, nombra la misma biblioteca."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Si le fichier arrive plus tard depuis %@, il désigne la même bibliothèque."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se il file arriva più tardi tramite %@, identifica la stessa libreria."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se o arquivo chegar de %@ mais tarde, ele indicará a mesma biblioteca."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Если файл позже поступит через %@, он будет указывать на ту же библиотеку."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Якщо файл пізніше надійде (джерело: %@), він назве ту саму бібліотеку."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "如果该文件稍后从 %@ 传来，它所标识的就是同一个资料库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the file is not written in %@, TextMouth refuses it, and nothing changes." : {
      "comment" : "Text of Speak Info, Book Information's braille code and text encoding rows, and the re-read alerts. What the alert says first of a choice to or from Unicode braille patterns, which the re-read checks byte by byte before it changes anything (BrailleBookReader.requireReadable(_:as:)), so a wrong one is refused at its first line (review of October 30, finding 5): a file not written in the code named codeName, the one chosen, is refused, and nothing changes. \"If the file is not written in Unicode braille patterns, TextMouth refuses it, and nothing changes.\". Placeholders in order: codeName.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Wenn die Datei nicht in %@ geschrieben ist, lehnt TextMouth sie ab, und nichts ändert sich."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Si el archivo no está escrito en %@, TextMouth lo rechaza y no cambia nada."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Si le fichier n’est pas écrit en %@, TextMouth le refuse, et rien ne change."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se il file non è scritto in %@, TextMouth lo rifiuta e non cambia nulla."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se o arquivo não estiver escrito em %@, o TextMouth o recusa e nada muda."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Если файл не записан в «%@», TextMouth отклонит его, и ничего не изменится."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Якщо файл не записано в «%@», TextMouth відхилить його, і нічого не зміниться."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "如果文件不是以 %@ 写成的，TextMouth 会拒绝读取，并且不会更改任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the library's own %@ arrives from %@ later, %@ may keep two copies of it, and this Mac and the other would disagree about which library this is." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of the question asked before giving the library a new identity file. %1$@ is the identity file's name, which stays as written; %2$@ and %3$@ are the cloud service's name, or \"the cloud\" when it is unknown.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Wenn die eigene Datei %1$@ der Bibliothek später von %2$@ eintrifft, behält %3$@ möglicherweise zwei Kopien davon, und dieser Mac und der andere wären sich uneins, welche Bibliothek dies ist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "If the library's own %1$@ arrives from %2$@ later, %3$@ may keep two copies of it, and this Mac and the other would disagree about which library this is."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Si el %1$@ de la propia biblioteca llega más tarde desde %2$@, puede que %3$@ conserve dos copias, y esta Mac y la otra no coincidirían en cuál es esta biblioteca."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Si le fichier %1$@ propre à la bibliothèque arrive plus tard depuis %2$@, %3$@ peut en conserver deux copies, et ce Mac et l’autre ne seraient pas d’accord sur la bibliothèque dont il s’agit."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se il file %@ della libreria arriva più tardi tramite %@, %@ potrebbe conservarne due copie, e questo Mac e l’altro non concorderebbero su quale libreria sia."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se o %1$@ da própria biblioteca chegar de %2$@ mais tarde, %3$@ poderá manter duas cópias dele, e este Mac e o outro discordarão sobre qual é esta biblioteca."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Если собственный файл %1$@ библиотеки позже поступит через %2$@, %3$@ может сохранить две копии, и этот Mac и другой не смогут договориться, какая это библиотека."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Якщо власний файл %1$@ бібліотеки пізніше надійде (джерело: %2$@), %3$@ може зберегти дві його копії, і цей Mac та інший розходитимуться щодо того, яка це бібліотека."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "如果资料库自己的 %1$@ 稍后从 %2$@ 传来，%3$@ 可能会保留它的两个副本，这台 Mac 和另一台就会对这是哪个资料库产生分歧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
