      }
    },
    "It belongs to its feed while it is downloaded. %@ removes its file and keeps its place and bookmarks." : {
      "comment" : "Why a feed episode's book cannot be removed from the library: it belongs to its feed. %@ is the name of the Delete Download command, which the sentence recommends.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Es gehört zu seinem Feed, solange es heruntergeladen ist. %@ entfernt die Datei und behält die Stelle und die Lesezeichen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Pertenece a su canal mientras está descargado. %@ quita su archivo y conserva su lugar y sus marcadores."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il appartient à son flux tant qu’il est téléchargé. %@ retire son fichier et conserve sa position et ses signets."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Appartiene al suo feed finché è scaricato. %@ rimuove il suo file e conserva il punto di lettura e i segnalibri."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ele pertence ao feed enquanto está baixado. %@ remove o arquivo dele e mantém a posição e os marcadores."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Пока книга загружена, она принадлежит своей ленте. %@ удаляет её файл и сохраняет позицию чтения и закладки."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Вона належить своїй стрічці, поки її завантажено. %@ видаляє її файл і зберігає місце та закладки."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It can be downloaded again." : {
      "comment" : "What VoiceOver says after Delete Download deleted a download that kept nothing of the listener's: the item can be downloaded again.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Es kann erneut heruntergeladen werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se puede descargar de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il peut être téléchargé de nouveau."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Può essere scaricato di nuovo."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ele pode ser baixado novamente."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Её можно загрузить снова."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Її можна завантажити знову."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It can be read again now. Choose Try Again to use it." : {
      "comment" : "Why Rebuild Library Index replaced nothing: the library index can be read again. It follows the sentence \"The library index was not rebuilt.\", so \"It\" is the index. Try Again is a button name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Er kann jetzt wieder gelesen werden. Wähle „Erneut versuchen“, um ihn zu verwenden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ya se puede leer de nuevo. Elige Reintentar para usarlo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il peut de nouveau être lu. Choisissez Réessayer pour l’utiliser."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ora può essere letto di nuovo. Scegli Riprova per usarlo."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ele pode ser lido de novo agora. Escolha Tentar novamente para usá-lo."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Теперь его можно прочитать. Выберите «Повторить», чтобы использовать его."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Її знову можна прочитати. Виберіть «Повторити», щоб використати її."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "现在可以再次读取它了。选择“重试”来使用它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It cannot be recovered." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence of the confirmation about the original file of a book just imported, and the hint of its Delete Permanently button: the file is gone for good.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Das lässt sich nicht rückgängig machen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se puede recuperar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il ne peut pas être récupéré."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Non può essere recuperato."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Não é possível recuperá-lo."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Восстановить будет невозможно."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Відновити неможливо."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It could not be copied into the library." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why a book could not move into the current library format. \"It\" is the book's original file.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
