    "Library" : {
      "comment" : "Heading of the group of Library window keyboard shortcuts in Settings, and the title of the Library menu.\nText of the Library tab of Settings, a list of the views the Library window offers (built-in views and the listener's own). The tab's name in the Settings window's toolbar.\nThe name spoken for the library's top level, the place that holds the folders and the books outside any folder, as in \"Library, 743 books\" after going to it.\nThe top of the library, as the Save in pop-up of the Record window names it.\nTitle of the Library menu in the menu bar, which holds the commands for the library's books and folders. Only a Library window shows it.\nTitle of the first screen, the list of the user's books and folders.",
