            "value" : "资料库现在显示根据磁盘上的图书重建的临时列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library's identity file is on this Mac, but its index, %@, hasn't arrived from %@." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why the library can't open: its index file did not arrive from the cloud service. %1$@ is the index's file name, which stays as written; %2$@ is the cloud service's name, or \"the cloud\" when it is unknown.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die Identitätsdatei der Bibliothek ist auf diesem Mac, aber ihr Suchindex %1$@ ist von %2$@ noch nicht angekommen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The library's identity file is on this Mac, but its index, %1$@, hasn't arrived from %2$@."
