            "value" : "Манифест «%1$@» нельзя изменить: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "无法编辑 %1$@ 的清单：%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone Punch In records from. TextMouth remembers it, apart from macOS's input." : {
      "comment" : "Hint of the audio editor's microphone pop-up. \"Record window\" is TextMouth's window that records audio.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Das Mikrofon, von dem „Darüber aufnehmen“ aufnimmt. TextMouth merkt es sich, unabhängig vom Eingang von macOS."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El micrófono que usa Grabar encima para grabar. TextMouth lo recuerda, aparte de la entrada de macOS."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Le microphone avec lequel Enregistrer par-dessus enregistre. TextMouth s’en souvient, indépendamment de l’entrée de macOS."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il microfono da cui registra Registra sopra. TextMouth lo ricorda, a prescindere dall’ingresso di macOS."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O microfone de onde Gravar por cima grava. O TextMouth o memoriza, separado da entrada do macOS."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Микрофон, с которого ведёт запись «Записать поверх». TextMouth запоминает его отдельно от входа macOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone TextMouth used last isn't connected, so recordings use %@." : {
      "comment" : "Said by the Record window when the microphone used last is not connected as the window opens. %@ is the name of the microphone recordings use instead.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Das zuletzt von TextMouth verwendete Mikrofon ist nicht verbunden, daher verwenden Aufnahmen %@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El micrófono que TextMouth usó por última vez no está conectado, así que las grabaciones usan %@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Le microphone que TextMouth a utilisé en dernier n’est pas connecté, donc les enregistrements utilisent %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il microfono usato per ultimo da TextMouth non è collegato, quindi le registrazioni usano %@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O microfone usado por último pelo TextMouth não está conectado, então as gravações usam %@."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Микрофон, который TextMouth использовал в прошлый раз, не подключён, поэтому запись ведётся с микрофона «%@»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone to record from. TextMouth remembers it; the input macOS uses elsewhere is unchanged." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint and tooltip of the Microphone pop-up in the Record window. TextMouth is the app's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Das Mikrofon, von dem aufgenommen wird. TextMouth merkt es sich; der Eingang, den macOS sonst verwendet, bleibt unverändert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El micrófono con el que se graba. TextMouth lo recuerda; la entrada que macOS usa en otros lugares no cambia."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Le microphone avec lequel enregistrer. TextMouth s’en souvient ; l’entrée que macOS utilise ailleurs n’est pas modifiée."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il microfono da cui registrare. TextMouth lo ricorda; l’ingresso che macOS usa altrove non cambia."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O microfone para gravar. O TextMouth o memoriza; a entrada que o macOS usa em outros lugares não muda."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Микрофон для записи. TextMouth запоминает его; вход, который macOS использует в других местах, не меняется."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The migrated copy is missing the content for %@." : {
      "comment" : "Why a move of the data directory failed: the copy lacks a book's content. %@ is the book's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
