          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech engine refused to speak the text here, twice, so speech stopped. Play tries again from the same place." : {
      "comment" : "Summary under the heading of the report of a refusal, on the Mac and the iPhone: what happened, and that Play tries again.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die Sprachausgabe hat sich geweigert, den Text hier zu sprechen, zweimal, daher stoppte das Vorlesen. „Wiedergeben“ versucht es von derselben Stelle erneut."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El motor de voz se negó a leer el texto de aquí, dos veces, así que la lectura se detuvo. Reproducir vuelve a intentarlo desde el mismo lugar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Le moteur vocal a refusé de lire le texte ici, deux fois, donc la lecture s’est arrêtée. Lire réessaie à partir du même endroit."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il motore vocale ha rifiutato due volte di leggere il testo qui, quindi la lettura si è interrotta. Riproduci riprova dallo stesso punto."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O mecanismo de fala se recusou a falar o texto aqui, duas vezes, então a fala parou. Reproduzir tenta de novo a partir do mesmo ponto."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Речевой движок дважды отказался произнести здесь текст, поэтому речь остановилась. «Воспроизвести» повторит попытку с того же места."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech model for %@ isn't on this Mac yet. Download it first." : {
      "comment" : "Error shown when transcription is tried before the language's speech model is downloaded. %@ is the language's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
