    },
    "The text of this book %@, which TextMouth can't export safely. Choose Edit Text, flatten the nesting, and save; then export again." : {
      "comment" : "Why a book's text was not exported: it nests quotes, lists, or emphasis too deeply, and has no chapter markers. %@ is the clause that says how deep, such as \"nests quotes, lists, or emphasis more than 128 levels deep\". \"Edit Text\" is a command.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Der Text dieses Buchs %@, und TextMouth kann ihn nicht sicher exportieren. Wähle „Text bearbeiten“, ebne die Verschachtelung ein und sichere; exportiere dann erneut."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El texto de este libro %@, y TextMouth no puede exportarlo con seguridad. Elige Editar texto, aplana el anidado y guarda; después vuelve a exportar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Le texte de ce livre %@, ce que TextMouth ne peut pas exporter sans risque. Choisissez Modifier le texte, aplatissez l’imbrication et enregistrez ; puis exportez de nouveau."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il testo di questo libro %@, e TextMouth non può esportarlo in sicurezza. Scegli Modifica testo, appiattisci l’annidamento e salva; poi esporta di nuovo."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O texto deste livro %@, e o TextMouth não consegue exportar com segurança. Escolha Editar texto, desfaça o aninhamento e salve; depois exporte de novo."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Текст этой книги %@, и TextMouth не может безопасно его экспортировать. Выберите «Изменить текст», уберите вложенность, сохраните и экспортируйте снова."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The text was reloaded, but the editor's file does not say what encoding it is in, so some characters may be wrong." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the note after Reload from Editor read a file whose text encoding nothing in it tells.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
