    },
    "The view this window showed was deleted. It now shows %@." : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Library window's View pop-up and Go to View. What a window announces when the view it showed was deleted, from Settings or by a change of config.json, and it shows name, the first view its pop-up offers, instead. Placeholders in order: name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die Ansicht, die dieses Fenster zeigte, wurde gelöscht. Es zeigt jetzt %@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La vista que mostraba esta ventana se eliminó. Ahora muestra %@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La vue que cette fenêtre affichait a été supprimée. Elle affiche maintenant %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La vista mostrata da questa finestra è stata eliminata. Ora mostra %@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "A visualização que esta janela mostrava foi excluída. Agora ela mostra %@."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Представление, которое показывало это окно, удалено. Теперь окно показывает %@."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Вигляд, який показувало це вікно, було видалено. Тепер воно показує %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "此窗口显示的视图已被删除。现在显示 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice changed its kind of audio partway through “%@”." : {
      "comment" : "Why a chapter of a spoken audio export could not be spoken: the voice changed its audio format. %@ is the chapter's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die Stimme hat mittendrin in „%@“ ihre Audioart gewechselt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La voz cambió su tipo de audio a mitad de «%@»."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La voix a changé de type d’audio en cours de « %@ »."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La voce ha cambiato tipo di audio a metà di “%@”."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "A voz mudou o tipo de áudio no meio de “%@”."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Голос сменил тип аудио посреди главы «%@»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice made no sound for “%@”. Check that it speaks the book's language." : {
      "comment" : "Why a chapter of a spoken audio export could not be spoken: the voice made no sound. %@ is the chapter's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die Stimme hat für „%@“ keinen Ton erzeugt. Prüfe, ob sie die Sprache des Buchs spricht."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La voz no emitió ningún sonido para «%@». Comprueba que hable el idioma del libro."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La voix n’a émis aucun son pour « %@ ». Vérifiez qu’elle parle la langue du livre."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La voce non ha prodotto alcun suono per “%@”. Controlla che parli la lingua del libro."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "A voz não produziu som para “%@”. Verifique se ela fala o idioma do livro."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Голос не издал ни звука для главы «%@». Проверьте, говорит ли он на языке книги."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice stopped partway through “%@”, and TextMouth stopped waiting." : {
      "comment" : "Why a chapter of a spoken audio export could not be spoken: the voice stalled. %@ is the chapter's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die Stimme blieb mittendrin in „%@“ stehen, und TextMouth hat nicht länger gewartet."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La voz se detuvo a mitad de «%@», y TextMouth dejó de esperar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La voix s’est arrêtée en cours de « %@ », et TextMouth a cessé d’attendre."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La voce si è interrotta a metà di “%@” e TextMouth ha smesso di aspettare."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "A voz parou no meio de “%@”, e o TextMouth parou de esperar."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Голос остановился посреди главы «%@», и TextMouth перестал ждать."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The words TextMouth reads aloud, as plain text, each chapter under its title." : {
      "comment" : "The hint of the Text as plain text checkbox in the Export dialog.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die Wörter, die TextMouth vorliest, als reiner Text, jedes Kapitel unter seinem Titel."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Las palabras que TextMouth lee en voz alta, como texto sin formato, con cada capítulo bajo su título."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Les mots que TextMouth lit à voix haute, en texte brut, chaque chapitre sous son titre."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Le parole che TextMouth legge ad alta voce, come testo semplice, ogni capitolo sotto il suo titolo."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "As palavras que o TextMouth lê em voz alta, como texto simples, cada capítulo sob seu título."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Слова, которые TextMouth читает вслух, обычным текстом; каждая глава под своим заголовком."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their %@ are kept." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence that says what is kept of every one of several deleted downloads. %@ is a list of parts, such as \"places and bookmarks\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ihre %@ bleiben erhalten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Sus %@ se conservan."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Leurs %@ sont conservés."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Vengono conservati: %@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Estes itens são mantidos: %@."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "У каждой сохраняются: %@."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Їхні %@ збережено."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "它们的%@会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their original files were not changed." : {
      "comment" : "Second sentence of the alert about several books that could not move into the current library format.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ihre Originaldateien wurden nicht geändert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Sus archivos originales no se modificaron."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Leurs fichiers d’origine n’ont pas été modifiés."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "I loro file originali non sono stati modificati."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Os arquivos originais deles não foram alterados."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Их исходные файлы не изменены."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Їхні оригінальні файли не змінено."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "它们的原始文件未被更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their places, bookmarks, and transcripts, if they have any, are kept, and they can be downloaded again." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence about several deleted downloads: what the listener left in them is kept, and they can be downloaded again.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ihre Positionen, Lesezeichen und Transkripte, falls vorhanden, bleiben erhalten, und sie können erneut heruntergeladen werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Sus lugares, marcadores y transcripciones, si los tienen, se conservan, y se pueden descargar de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Leurs positions, signets et transcriptions, s’ils en ont, sont conservés, et ils peuvent être téléchargés de nouveau."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La loro posizione, i segnalibri e le trascrizioni, se ne hanno, vengono conservati e possono essere scaricati di nuovo."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Suas posições, marcadores e transcrições, se tiverem, são mantidos, e eles podem ser baixados novamente."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Места, закладки и расшифровки, если они есть, сохраняются, и их можно загрузить снова."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Їхні місця, закладки та транскрипції, якщо вони є, збережено, і їх можна завантажити знову."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "它们的位置、书签和文字稿（如果有）都会保留，并且可以再次下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then take it off the reading list, or clear %@ in the Reading List's options." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of why Remove Download was refused for a book the listener keeps and the reading list keeps too: what to do after choosing Stop Keeping on This Mac. %@ is the name of the Reading List's option that keeps its books downloaded, as the option shows it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Nimm es dann von der Leseliste oder deaktiviere %@ in den Optionen der Leseliste."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Luego quítalo de la lista de lectura, o desactiva %@ en las opciones de la lista de lectura."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Retirez-le ensuite de la liste de lecture, ou décochez %@ dans les options de la liste de lecture."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Poi toglilo dall’elenco di lettura, oppure disattiva %@ nelle opzioni dell’elenco di lettura."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Depois, tire-o da lista de leitura ou desmarque %@ nas opções da Lista de leitura."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Затем уберите её из списка для чтения или снимите отметку «%@» в параметрах списка для чтения."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Потім вилучіть її зі списку читання або зніміть позначку «%@» у параметрах списку читання."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "然后将它从阅读列表中移除，或在阅读列表的选项中取消勾选 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are no feeds to refresh." : {
      "comment" : "What VoiceOver says when Refresh All Feeds finds no feed in the library.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Es gibt keine Feeds zu aktualisieren."
