            "value" : "Этот файл содержит только часть книги Kindle. Откройте основной файл .kfx книги."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "此文件只包含 Kindle 图书的一部分。请打开该图书的主 .kfx 文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file is a Kindle Create package, which TextMouth can't read yet." : {
      "comment" : "Why a file could not be imported: it is a package that Kindle Create writes for an author, which TextMouth does not read yet. Kindle Create is a program's name.",
