        }
      }
    },
    "Use the global setting (%@)" : {
      "comment" : "A choice of the Open the next book in pop-up button in Feed Info and Folder Settings: do as Settings says. %@ is the name of the choice Settings has now, such as This Window.\nA choice of the pop-up button that sets what happens when an item ends, in Feed Info and Folder Settings: do as Settings says. %@ is the name of the choice Settings has now, such as Continue to Next Book.\nThe first choice of the Audio Info pop-up for a book's original audio: follow the global setting. %@ is that setting's name, such as \"Keep\".\nTitle of the checkbox that makes a feed follow the global setting. %@ is the global setting's value, such as \"Every item listed, newest 5 downloaded\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Globale Einstellung verwenden (%@)"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Usar el ajuste general (%@)"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Utiliser le réglage global (%@)"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Usa l’impostazione globale (%@)"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Usar o ajuste global (%@)"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Использовать общую настройку (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use this after restoring the file from a backup, fixing its permissions, or updating TextMouth to the version that saved it." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of what Try Again does on the library index recovery sheet: when to use it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Verwende dies, nachdem du die Datei aus einem Backup wiederhergestellt, ihre Berechtigungen korrigiert oder TextMouth auf die Version aktualisiert hast, die sie gesichert hat."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Úsalo después de restaurar el archivo desde una copia de seguridad, corregir sus permisos o actualizar TextMouth a la versión que lo guardó."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "À utiliser après avoir restauré le fichier depuis une sauvegarde, corrigé ses autorisations ou mis à jour TextMouth vers la version qui l’a enregistré."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Usalo dopo aver ripristinato il file da un backup, corretto i suoi permessi o aggiornato TextMouth alla versione che lo ha salvato."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Use isto depois de restaurar o arquivo de um backup, corrigir as permissões dele ou atualizar o TextMouth para a versão que o salvou."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Используйте после восстановления файла из резервной копии, исправления его прав доступа или обновления TextMouth до версии, которая его сохранила."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Використовуйте це після відновлення файлу з резервної копії, виправлення його дозволів або оновлення TextMouth до версії, яка його зберегла."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "在从备份恢复该文件、修复其权限，或将 TextMouth 更新到存储它的版本之后使用此项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
