          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "此图书结束时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you save, TextMouth checks the manifest and rearranges the book, keeping your place in its track." : {
      "comment" : "Fourth sentence of the Edit Manifest explanation: what happens when the user saves the manifest.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Beim Sichern prüft TextMouth das Manifest und ordnet das Buch neu an, wobei deine Stelle im Track erhalten bleibt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Al guardar, TextMouth comprueba el manifiesto y reorganiza el libro, conservando tu lugar en su pista."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "À l’enregistrement, TextMouth vérifie le manifeste et réorganise le livre, en gardant votre place dans sa piste."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Quando salvi, TextMouth controlla il manifest e riorganizza il libro, mantenendo la tua posizione nella traccia."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ao salvar, o TextMouth verifica o manifesto e reorganiza o livro, mantendo sua posição na faixa."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "При сохранении TextMouth проверяет манифест и перестраивает книгу, сохраняя ваше место в треке."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "存储时，TextMouth 会检查清单并重新编排图书，同时保持你在其音轨中的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you save, the book updates and keeps your place as near as it can." : {
      "comment" : "Fourth sentence of the Edit Text explanation: what happens when the user saves the edited text.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Beim Sichern wird das Buch aktualisiert und behält deine Stelle so genau wie möglich bei."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Al guardar, el libro se actualiza y conserva tu lugar lo mejor que puede."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "À l’enregistrement, le livre se met à jour et garde votre place au plus près."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Quando salvi, il libro si aggiorna e mantiene la tua posizione il più vicino possibile."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ao salvar, o livro é atualizado e mantém sua posição o mais perto possível."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "При сохранении книга обновляется и по возможности сохраняет ваше место."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "存储时，图书会更新，并尽量保持你的阅读位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
